{"id":"n87012-2-7","stage":4,"title":"헛되다 · 荒诞","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n87012-2-7-1","ko":"나는 곧 세계에서 제일가는 부자가 될 거야.","zh":"我很快就会变成世界上最富有的那个人了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곧","meaning":"就，马上，即将","explanation":"곧：就，马上，即将","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"2","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세계에서","meaning":"世界","explanation":"세계：世界；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"세계","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62444","senseId":"3","lemma":"세계","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"제일가는","meaning":"第一，最佳","explanation":"제일가다：第一，最佳；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"제일가다","audio":"/audio/3bb11dcb1f097162bf3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83615","senseId":"1","lemma":"제일가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부자가","meaning":"富翁，富豪，富人","explanation":"부자：富翁，富豪，富人；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"부자","audio":"/audio/2d4b9735cbc268247e90.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59725","senseId":"1","lemma":"부자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"될","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"就，马上，即将","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"时间没过多久。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"28403a52feffec21","term":"세계","zh":"世界","audio":"/audio/28403a52feffec214da2.mp3","entryId":"62444","definition":"某个方面或特定社会；或指其领域。","pronunciation":["세ː계","세ː게"]},{"id":"3bb11dcb1f097162","term":"제일가다","zh":"第一，最佳","audio":"/audio/3bb11dcb1f097162bf3a.mp3","entryId":"83615","definition":"在多个中最优秀。","pronunciation":["제ː일가다"]},{"id":"2d4b9735cbc26824","term":"부자","zh":"富翁，富豪，富人","audio":"/audio/2d4b9735cbc268247e90.mp3","entryId":"59725","definition":"财产丰厚、生活富足的人。","pronunciation":["부ː자"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/0bc67ef92ce242e54d30.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n87012-2-7-2","ko":"그런 헛된 말은 이제 그만해 줄래?","zh":"请别再说这种不切实际的话了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"헛된","meaning":"荒诞，无稽，虚妄","explanation":"헛되다：荒诞，无稽，虚妄；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"헛되다","audio":"/audio/ce140b61e1879e3f92e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87012","senseId":"2","lemma":"헛되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말은","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그만해","meaning":"停止，停","explanation":"그만하다：停止，停；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"그만하다","audio":"/audio/129344a9c4625793da06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37072","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄래?","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；ㄹ래：非敬语地表达意愿或询问对方意愿。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"ce140b61e1879e3f","term":"헛되다","zh":"荒诞，无稽，虚妄","audio":"/audio/ce140b61e1879e3f92e4.mp3","entryId":"87012","definition":"荒唐无端，让人无法相信。","pronunciation":["헏뙤다","헏뛔다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"129344a9c4625793","term":"그만하다","zh":"停止，停","audio":"/audio/129344a9c4625793da06.mp3","entryId":"37072","definition":"停住正在做的事。","pronunciation":["그만하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3bd0f5a9a843d3de83cb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.873,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=87012","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语